+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/*
+ * Qualcomm Peripheral Image Loader
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2016 Linaro Ltd
+ * Copyright (C) 2015 Sony Mobile Communications Inc
